{"id":2472,"date":"2026-08-29T16:08:14","date_gmt":"2026-08-29T16:08:14","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/?post_type=knowledgebase&#038;p=2472"},"modified":"2026-08-29T17:22:38","modified_gmt":"2026-08-29T17:22:38","slug":"template-page-size-badges","status":"publish","type":"knowledgebase","link":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/db\/templates\/template-page-size-badges\/","title":{"rendered":"Template Page Size Badges"},"content":{"rendered":"<div style=\"color: #2b2b2b;\">\n<h2 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Template Page Size Badges<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-2486\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/TemplatePageSizeBadges.webp\" alt=\"Template Page Size Badges\" width=\"128\" height=\"152\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/TemplatePageSizeBadges.webp 777w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/TemplatePageSizeBadges-253x300.webp 253w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/TemplatePageSizeBadges-768x909.webp 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 128px) 100vw, 128px\" \/><\/span><\/h2>\n<p class=\"western\">Starting a new project with the correct canvas dimensions is crucial for ensuring your final design prints correctly or looks sharp on a digital screen. When browsing the <strong>Publication Templates Gallery<\/strong> (accessible via the Startup Dashboard or the File menu), you can instantly identify the exact document dimensions of any template before you even click it, thanks to our intelligent <strong>Page Size Badges<\/strong>. This eliminates the frustration of opening a great-looking template only to discover it&#8217;s the completely wrong aspect ratio for your specific needs.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Identifying Template Formats<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-2485\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/IdentifyingTemplateFormats.webp\" alt=\"Identifying Template Formats\" width=\"120\" height=\"105\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/IdentifyingTemplateFormats.webp 481w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/IdentifyingTemplateFormats-300x263.webp 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 120px) 100vw, 120px\" \/><\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">Finding a template&#8217;s size is incredibly easy at a glance. Look at the bottom-right corner of any template thumbnail preview card in the gallery. You will see a small, semi-transparent teal pill with a sleek frosted-glass effect displaying the page format. This badge is designed to be highly legible without covering up important design details on the thumbnail itself.<\/p>\n<div style=\"display: flex; width: 100%; align-items: flex-start;\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-2475\" style=\"border-radius: 12px; width: 40%; height: auto; margin: 0; display: block;\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/PublicationTemplates.webp_2K_202608291705.jpeg\" alt=\"Publication Templates\" width=\"2048\" height=\"2048\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/PublicationTemplates.webp_2K_202608291705.jpeg 2048w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/PublicationTemplates.webp_2K_202608291705-300x300.jpeg 300w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/PublicationTemplates.webp_2K_202608291705-1024x1024.jpeg 1024w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/PublicationTemplates.webp_2K_202608291705-150x150.jpeg 150w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/PublicationTemplates.webp_2K_202608291705-768x768.jpeg 768w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/PublicationTemplates.webp_2K_202608291705-1536x1536.jpeg 1536w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2048px) 100vw, 2048px\" \/> <span style=\"font-size: 18pt; color: #ffffff;\">&#8211;<\/span><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-2476\" style=\"border-radius: 12px; width: 60%; height: auto; margin: 0; display: block;\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/DashboardTemplates.webp_2K_202608291656-scaled.jpeg\" alt=\"Dashboard\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1333\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/DashboardTemplates.webp_2K_202608291656-scaled.jpeg 2560w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/DashboardTemplates.webp_2K_202608291656-300x156.jpeg 300w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/DashboardTemplates.webp_2K_202608291656-1024x533.jpeg 1024w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/DashboardTemplates.webp_2K_202608291656-768x400.jpeg 768w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/DashboardTemplates.webp_2K_202608291656-1536x800.jpeg 1536w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/DashboardTemplates.webp_2K_202608291656-2048x1067.jpeg 2048w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><\/div>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">How the Badges Work<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-2483\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/HowTheBadgesWork.webp\" alt=\"How the Badges Work\" width=\"129\" height=\"134\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/HowTheBadgesWork.webp 417w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/HowTheBadgesWork-288x300.webp 288w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 129px) 100vw, 129px\" \/><\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">Instead of relying on manually typed descriptions that can sometimes be inaccurate, Open Publisher dynamically scans the internal geometric data of every template as the gallery loads and automatically assigns the correct, verified badge label:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Standard Paper &#8211;<\/strong> Essential for physical publishing. The engine automatically recognises and labels standard print formats including <strong>A4, Letter, A5, A3, Legal, and Tabloid<\/strong>. If the document is intentionally rotated for a wide layout, it will dynamically display a <strong>Landscape<\/strong> suffix (for example, &#8220;A4 Landscape&#8221;).<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Square &#8211;<\/strong> Documents built with equal width and height dimensions are labelled cleanly as <strong>Square<\/strong>. These templates are perfect for Instagram posts, CD covers, or grid-based digital portfolios.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Video Resolutions &#8211;<\/strong> Digital-first templates tailored for screens are recognised by their standard resolution (e.g., <strong>1080p, 4K, 720p<\/strong>). Portrait variants, such as a tall 1080&#215;1920 design intended for a mobile social media story or digital signage, are accurately labelled with a <strong>Portrait<\/strong> suffix.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Custom Sizes &#8211;<\/strong> If a template uses a completely custom, non-standard layout (such as a slim web banner, specialized merchandise, or unique fold-out brochure), the badge seamlessly falls back to displaying the raw pixel dimensions (e.g., <strong>632 \u00d7 900<\/strong>) so you always know exactly what size canvas you are about to open.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Eliminating Guesswork<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-2481\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/EliminatingGuesswork.webp\" alt=\"Eliminating Guesswork\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/EliminatingGuesswork.webp 306w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/EliminatingGuesswork-300x300.webp 300w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/EliminatingGuesswork-150x150.webp 150w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 128px) 100vw, 128px\" \/><\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">By bringing this data to the surface of the gallery, Page Size Badges save you the hassle of loading a document, opening the page setup menu just to check its size, and then closing it to find another. You can browse with total confidence knowing the template you choose is technically ready for your final output.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Template Page Size Badges Starting a new project with the correct canvas dimensions is crucial for ensuring your final design prints correctly or looks sharp on a digital screen. When browsing the Publication Templates Gallery (accessible via the Startup Dashboard or the File menu), you can instantly identify the exact document dimensions of any template [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":2486,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","template":"","knowledgebase_cat":[28],"class_list":["post-2472","knowledgebase","type-knowledgebase","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","knowledgebase_cat-templates"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/2472","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase"}],"about":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/knowledgebase"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=2472"}],"version-history":[{"count":16,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/2472\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":2496,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/2472\/revisions\/2496"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/2486"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=2472"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"knowledgebase_cat","embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase_cat?post=2472"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}